<title>HONG KONG: SiS Int'l 1996 net rises 14.64 percent.</title>
<headline>SiS Int'l 1996 net rises 14.64 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   10.96     vs 9.6</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    3.0	 vs 2.5</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  2.13 loss vs 2.00 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    27.96     vs 24.39</p>
<p>    Turnover		     2,274.64  vs 1,606.18</p>
<p>    Company name		 SiS International Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  May 26-30</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   July 18</p>
<p>NOTE - SiS International is a wholesale distributor of microcomputer products.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional loss of HK$1.57 million on disposal of investment property and loss of HK$0.56 million on closure of Taiwan Branch.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is three H.K. cents vs 2.5 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
